# Click memory

- Use Click MCP tools (`remember`, `recall`, `update_memory`, `forget`) for durable project/user knowledge.
- Save preferences, decisions, conventions, and lessons with `remember` (scope `user` for personal, `project` for this repo).
- Prefer `update_memory` when a duplicate warning appears.
- Overview memories are injected at session start. Call `recall` when you need prompt-relevant search — Cursor does not auto-FTS each turn like Pi.
